---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteNav from '../../components/SiteNav.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import D from '../../../data/source.js';
const G=D.presence.aiEvaluationSnapshot, PG=G.provingGround, A=G.arena;
const title=`Gray Swan profile evidence — ${G.displayDate}`;
const description=`Public profile snapshot: Proving Ground #${PG.rank}, ${PG.percentile}, ${PG.totalBreaks} platform-recorded breaks. Arena metrics are separate.`;
const evidenceJsonLd={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'DigitalDocument',name:title,description,url:`https://mariomarcolongo.com${G.evidencePath}`,dateCreated:G.preservedAtUtc,dateModified:G.observedAt,isBasedOn:G.sourceUrl,author:{'@id':'https://mariomarcolongo.com/#person'}};
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={`https://mariomarcolongo.com${G.evidencePath}`}><Fragment slot="head"><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(evidenceJsonLd)}></script></Fragment><SiteNav/><main id="main-content" class="presence-shell case-shell"><p><a href="/ai-evaluation">AI evaluation work</a></p><p class="meta">Logged-out public profile capture · {G.displayDate}</p><h1>Gray Swan profile evidence.</h1><p class="lede">Proving Ground: #{PG.rank}, {PG.percentile}, {PG.totalBreaks} platform-recorded total breaks. Arena separately displays #{A.rank}, {A.uniqueBreaks} unique breaks, {A.points.toLocaleString('en-US')} points and {A.submissions} submissions.</p><div class="source-links"><a href={G.sourceUrl}>Live public profile ↗</a><a href="/evidence/gray-swan-profile-2026-09-30.json">Structured transcription &amp; preservation record</a><a href="/evidence/gray-swan-2026-07-29/">Previous July snapshot</a></div><figure class="actual-artifact"><a href={G.originalImage}><img src={G.previewImage} srcset="/media/work/gray-swan-profile-2026-09-30-800.webp 800w, /media/work/gray-swan-profile-2026-09-30-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" alt="Original public Gray Swan profile captured 30 September 2026, showing Proving Ground rank 79, top 5%, 127 total breaks and separate Arena results" width="1280" height="1675"/></a><figcaption>Unchanged original capture: {G.originalDimensions.join(' × ')} JPEG. WebP compression is used for this preview; select it to inspect the original.</figcaption></figure><section><h2>Separate testing systems</h2><p>Proving Ground reports #{PG.rank} ({PG.percentile}) and {PG.totalBreaks} total breaks. Arena reports #{A.rank}, {A.uniqueBreaks} unique breaks, {A.points.toLocaleString('en-US')} points and {A.submissions} submissions. These metrics must not be added together.</p><ul>{PG.areas.map(area=><li>{area.name}: {area.breaks} / {area.available}; {area.displayedPercent}% displayed.</li>)}</ul><p>The four visible area counters sum to {PG.displayedAreaTotal}, while the platform displays {PG.totalBreaks} total breaks. Both values are retained without inferring an internal aggregation rule.</p></section><section><h2>What the record establishes</h2><p>This is evidence of dated platform-recorded model-testing activity. It is not paid employment at Gray Swan, a security certification, a reproduction of every adjudicated result or an estimate of the failure rate of models generally. Rankings and percentiles can change as the participant pool changes.</p><p>The July record remains separately preserved. Its #74/top 6% ranking and 113 total breaks should not be described as current, or combined with these totals as additional breaks.</p></section><details><summary>Original capture SHA-256</summary><p class="capture-hash">{G.originalSha256}</p><p>Capture saved {G.preservedAtUtc}. The JSON transcription is generated from the canonical snapshot record.</p><a href={G.originalImage}>Open unchanged original JPEG</a></details><p><a href="/cv-ai">AI evaluation résumé →</a></p></main><SiteFooter/></Layout>
<style>.capture-hash{overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.6 monospace}</style>
